  "definition": "Animal Burial Grounds",
  "effectiveDate": "2024-12-21",
  "historyNote": "#6619-B, eff 10-29-97; (See Revision Note at chapter heading for Env-Sw 800); ss by #8459, eff 10-28-05 (formerly Env-Wm 2510.08); ss by #10597, eff 7-1-14; ss by #14156, eff 12-21-24",
